---
/*
 * The artifact: a page with a signature and a verification QR on it, drawn
 * rather than screenshotted so it takes the theme's --paper tokens and stays
 * sharp at any size. Lifted verbatim from design/prototypes/hero.html, which
 * generates it; this is the rendered output, so there is no build step here.
 *
 * .paper (design/base.css) supplies the sheet itself. Paper has no dark mode:
 * in the dark theme this is the one bright object on the screen, which is the
 * picture worth making.
 */
---

